   * purposes. The audit log model records system and domain events such as
   * authentication attempts, invitation events, moderation actions, exports,
   * and resource changes. Queryable criteria include event_type, activity
   * timestamps, actor identifiers (user or admin), target identifiers (list or
   * task), and full-text matches on the details field. The underlying table
